"France","r":"Burgundy","a":"Gevrey-Chambertin","g":["Pinot Noir"],"pr":75,"abv":13.5,"e":"15–18 months in French oak, about a third new","sv":"15–17°C","d":"45–60 minutes when young","w":"4–15 years","ds":"Gevrey''s broad shoulders in classic négociant form: dark cherry and plum over iron, damp earth and a gamey, spicy undertow. The tannins are firm but fine, and the wine needs a few years to relax into its savory, forest-floor middle age.","x":"284:2,285:60,286:62,287:52,288:65,289:70,290:70,291:38,292:0,293:20,14:80,1:45,12:35,15:35,3:20,71:30,151:50,148:45,143:45,149:15,188:25,126:20,135:30,123:15,157:25,156:15,214:55,216:35,237:60,245:75,242:50,255:50,251:30,258:70,259:35,282:80,279:55,294:100,297:100,299:100,310:100,315:100"},{"s":"henri-gouges-nuits-saint-georges","n":"Nuits-Saint-Georges","p":"Domaine Henri Gouges","t":"red","c":"France","r":"Burgundy","a":"Nuits-Saint-Georges","g":["Pinot Noir"],"pr":80,"abv":13,"e":"Destemmed; about 18 months in barrel, roughly 20% new","sv":"15–17°C","d":"1 hour when young","w":"6–20 years","ds":"Old-school Nuits from the appellation''s reference estate: sour and black cherry under a heavy layer of iron, earth and faintly gamey savor. Tight and almost severe on release, it is built for patience and opens into deeply savory Pinot.","x":"284:2,285:65,286:70,287:50,288:62,289:65,290:68,291:25,292:0,293:18,14:65,1:45,2:35,12:30,9:30,71:15,143:60,151:55,148:40,140:30,188:30,189:15,126:20,120:12,135:20,216:60,214:40,218:20,239:55,245:85,242:65,246:30,258:85,260:40,259:20,282:90,279:60,294:100,297:100,299:100,315:100"},{"s":"michel-lafarge-volnay-vendanges-selectionnees","n":"Volnay Vendanges Sélectionnées","p":"Domaine Michel Lafarge","t":"red","c":"France","r":"Burgundy","a":"Volnay","g":["Pinot Noir"],"pr":85,"abv":13,"e":"Largely destemmed; about 18 months in mostly older barrels; biodynamic farming","sv":"14–16°C","d":"30 minutes when young","w":"5–20 years","ds":"Volnay as lacework: red cherry, wild strawberry and red curr